{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266FxF6VbUK21794322146.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>軟銀集團第二季業績盈轉虧，是兩年來首次錄得虧損。</p><p></p><p>蝕1.1萬億日圓，去年同期則賺2.5萬億日圓。市場原本預期有1,290億日圓盈利，收入逾2.2萬億日圓，按年增加一成半。期內，錄得投資虧損1,336億日圓，去年同期則有投資收益3.4萬億日圓。集團旗下科技初創企業投資基金，願景基金虧損近816億日圓。 </p><p></p><p>總計上半年虧損7,680億日圓，去年同期則賺約2.9萬億日圓。期內，收入按年上升一成三，至逾4.2萬億日圓。 </p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T16:03:14.258748+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:27:05.640217+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T15:56:25.380905+00:00","content_hash":"3b46d8a671f4a5c1ff1575ab19c1bcea5a93350aac6cf1fcfa4ebb91a85908c6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T16:03:14.258748+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}